      "sc:description": "Offline, deterministic bioinformatics command-line tool for auditing protein FASTA sequences and PDB coordinate files. Analyzes amino-acid composition and ambiguous residues in FASTA files, and inventories observed C-alpha residues in the first PDB model. Produces structured JSON reports with source SHA-256 digests and bounded quality warnings. Supports reproducible execution and CWL workflow integration. Does not predict protein structures, assess folding accuracy, or validate molecular geometry.",
